roducible page_ids and page_hashes. Emit page_units and total_pages.",\n    "Mode": "Determine",\n    "Relevant": "No",\n    "Strength": 9,\n    "Claim": "None",\n    "Requirements": "None"\n}\n```\n\nNote on routing: this inquiry should be fulfilled by **openai_code_interpreter** (intake validation + deterministic chunking + page_id/page_hash generation). My own work would only begin *after* that step produces an already-chunked page unit — I would then render and gate each page one at a time.'}
