        "types": ["SSN", "NATIONAL_ID", "PASSPORT", "DRIVERS_LICENSE"]\n        },\n        "CONTACT": {\n          "description": "Direct communication contact information",\n          "types": ["EMAIL", "PHONE_NUMBER"]\n        },\n        "LOCATION": {\n          "description": "Physical addresses and network locations",\n          "types": ["STREET_ADDRESS", "IP_ADDRESS"]\n        },\n        "FINANCIAL": {\n          "description": "Banking, payment, and transaction identifiers",\n          "types": ["CREDIT_CARD", "BANK_ACCOUNT", "IBAN", "CVV"]\n        },\n        "DEMOGRAPHIC": {\n          "description": "Personal demographic attributes",\n          "types": ["DATE_OF_BIRTH"]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "PHI": {\n      "description": "Protected Health Information",\n      "subcategories": {\n        "MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER": {\n          "description": "Patient, member, or clinical record identifiers",\n          "types": ["PATIENT_ID", "MEDICAL_CASE_REF"]\n        },\n        "HEALTH_DATA": {\n          "description": "Medical conditions, diagnoses, allergies, and prescriptions",\n          "types": ["ALLERGY", "CONDITION", "PRESCRIPTION", "CLINICAL_NOTE"]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  "classifiers": [\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-SSN-001",\n      "name": "Social Security Number / National ID",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.95,\n      "priority": 1,\n      "mask_token": "[SSN]",\n      "description": "Standard 9-digit US Social Security Number in AAA-GG-SSSS format."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-CC-001",\n      "name": "Credit Card Number",\n      "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:4\\\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\\\d{2})[- ]?\\\\d{4}[- ]?\\\\d{4}[- ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b|\\\\b\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{4}-\\\\d{4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.95,\n      "priority": 1,\n      "mask_token": "[CREDIT_CARD]",\n      "description": "Major credit card numbers (Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Discover)."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-EMAIL-001",\n      "name": "Email Address",\n      "category": "PII.CONTACT.EMAIL",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.95,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[EMAIL]",\n      "description": "Standard RFC-compliant email address format."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PHONE-001",\n      "name": "Telephone Number",\n      "category": "PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "(?:\\\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\\\(\\\\d{3}\\\\)|\\\\b\\\\d{3})[-. ]?\\\\d{3}[-. ]?\\\\d{4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.90,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[PHONE_NUMBER]",\n      "description": "North American phone numbers with optional country code, parentheses, dashes, or dots."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IP-001",\n      "name": "IP Address (IPv4 & IPv6)",\n      "category": "PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\b|\\\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.90,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[IP_ADDRESS]",\n      "description": "IPv4 dotted-decimal and IPv6 8-group addresses."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DOB-001",\n      "name": "Date of Birth",\n      "category": "PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])\\\\b|\\\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01]),\\\\s+(?:19|20)\\\\d{2}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[DATE_OF_BIRTH]",\n      "description": "ISO-8601 dates and month-name formatted dates of birth."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-IBAN-001",\n      "name": "Bank Account (IBAN)",\n      "category": "PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]{2}\\\\d{2}(?:\\\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.90,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[BANK_ACCOUNT]",\n      "description": "International Bank Account Numbers with optional spacing."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001",\n      "name": "Passport Number",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b[A-Z]\\\\d{8,9}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[PASSPORT]",\n      "description": "Standard alphanumeric passport identifiers."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-DL-001",\n      "name": "Driver\'s License",\n      "category": "PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[DRIVERS_LICENSE]",\n      "description": "Standard state driver\'s license numbers with DL- prefix."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001",\n      "name": "Residential / Work Street Address",\n      "category": "PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b\\\\d{1,5}\\\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\\\s+[A-Za-z\\\\s]+,\\\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\\\s+\\\\d{5}(?:-\\\\d{4})?)?\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 4,\n      "mask_token": "[STREET_ADDRESS]",\n      "description": "Physical postal street address including street name, city, state, zip."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PII-NAME-001",\n      "name": "Full Name / Individual Name",\n      "category": "PII.PERSON_NAME",\n      "type": "ner",\n      "entity_types": ["PERSON"],\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.80,\n      "priority": 5,\n      "mask_token": "[NAME]",\n      "description": "Named entity person recognizer for personal and professional names."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001",\n      "name": "Medical Case Ref / Patient Member ID",\n      "category": "PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER",\n      "type": "regex",\n      "pattern": "\\\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\\\b",\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.90,\n      "priority": 2,\n      "mask_token": "[MEDICAL_ID]",\n      "description": "Identifiers for medical case references, patient IDs, member IDs."\n    },\n    {\n      "classifier_id": "CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001",\n      "name": "Health Condition / Prescription / Allergy",\n      "category": "PHI.HEALTH_DATA",\n      "type": "dictionary_and_heuristic",\n      "terms": [\n        "penicillin allergy",\n        "allergy",\n        "Hypertension",\n        "hypertension",\n        "prescription adjustment",\n        "emergency dispensation",\n        "medical dispensation"\n      ],\n      "confidence_threshold": 0.85,\n      "priority": 3,\n      "mask_token": "[HEALTH_DATA]",\n      "description": "Clinical health condition diagnoses, allergies, and prescription notations."\n    }\n  ],\n  "history": [\n    {\n      "revision_id": "rev-001",\n      "ruleset_version": "1.0.0",\n      "actor": "Human Admin",\n      "actor_id": "ADMIN-ROOT-001",\n      "timestamp": "2026-10-16T13:30:00Z",\n      "approval_token": "AUTH-TOKEN-ADMIN-REV1-APPROVED-20261016-ROOT",\n      "action": "CREATE_INITIAL_PINNED_REVISION",\n      "diff": {\n        "operation": "INIT",\n        "classifiers_added": 13,\n        "classifiers_removed": 0,\n        "classifiers_modified": 0\n      },\n      "comment": "Initial authoritative baseline provisioned and approved by Human Admin."\n    }\n  ],\n  "pending_admin_review": []\n}\n```\n\n## Decoded summary for pipeline consumption (rev-001, 13/13 classifiers enabled)\n\nNote: the JSON above stores patterns JSON-escaped; the decoded (runtime) pattern text is shown below exactly as it appears after JSON unescaping.\n\n| # | classifier_id | Category | Type | Priority | Confidence threshold | Exact pattern / definition |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `CLS-PII-SSN-001` | PII.IDENTIFIER.SSN | regex | 1 | 0.95 | `\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}\\b` |\n| 2 | `CLS-PII-CC-001` | PII.FINANCIAL.CREDIT_CARD | regex | 1 | 0.95 | `\\b(?:4\\d{3}|5[1-5]\\d{2}|6011|3[47]\\d{2})[- ]?\\d{4}[- ]?\\d{4}[- ]?\\d{4}\\b|\\b\\d{4}-\\d{4}-\\d{4}-\\d{4}\\b` |\n| 3 | `CLS-PII-EMAIL-001` | PII.CONTACT.EMAIL | regex | 2 | 0.95 | `\\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}\\b` |\n| 4 | `CLS-PII-PHONE-001` | PII.CONTACT.PHONE_NUMBER | regex | 2 | 0.90 | `(?:\\+?1[-. ]?)?(?:\\(\\d{3}\\)|\\b\\d{3})[-. ]?\\d{3}[-. ]?\\d{4}\\b` |\n| 5 | `CLS-PII-IP-001` | PII.LOCATION.IP_ADDRESS | regex | 3 | 0.90 | `\\b(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\b|\\b(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}:){7}[0-9a-fA-F]{1,4}\\b` |\n| 6 | `CLS-PII-DOB-001` | PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH | regex | 3 | 0.85 | `\\b(?:19|20)\\d{2}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])\\b|\\b(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)\\s+(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]),\\s+(?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b` |\n| 7 | `CLS-PII-IBAN-001` | PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT | regex | 2 | 0.90 | `\\b[A-Z]{2}\\d{2}(?:\\s?[A-Z0-9]{4}){3,7}\\b` |\n| 8 | `CLS-PII-PASSPORT-001` | PII.IDENTIFIER.PASSPORT | regex | 3 | 0.85 | `\\b[A-Z]\\d{8,9}\\b` |\n| 9 | `CLS-PII-DL-001` | PII.IDENTIFIER.DRIVERS_LICENSE | regex | 3 | 0.85 | `\\bDL-[A-Z0-9]{6,12}(?:-[A-Z]{2})?\\b` |\n| 10 | `CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001` | PII.LOCATION.STREET_ADDRESS | regex | 4 | 0.85 | `\\b\\d{1,5}\\s+[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,]+(?:Terrace|Street|St|Avenue|Ave|Road|Rd|Boulevard|Blvd|Way|Lane|Ln|Drive|Dr)(?:[A-Za-z0-9\\s.,#]+)?(?:,\\s+[A-Za-z\\s]+,\\s+[A-Z]{2}\\s+\\d{5}(?:-\\d{4})?)?\\b` |\n| 11 | `CLS-PII-NAME-001` | PII.PERSON_NAME | NER | 5 | 0.80 | NER entity types: `["PERSON"]` |\n| 12 | `CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001` | PHI.MEDICAL_IDENTIFIER | regex | 2 | 0.90 | `\\b(?:MC|MEM|PAT|REC)-[A-Za-z0-9-]{4,15}\\b` |\n| 13 | `CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001` | PHI.HEALTH_DATA | dictionary_and_heuristic | 3 | 0.85 | Dictionary terms: `penicillin allergy`, `allergy`, `Hypertension`, `hypertension`, `prescription adjustment`, `emergency dispensation`, `medical dispensation` |\n\n**Accept/reject thresholds:** the ruleset defines only the per-classifier `confidence_threshold` values shown above (no global threshold field exists in rev-001). Detections scoring at or above the classifier\'s own `confidence_threshold` are accepted; detections below it are rejected. No disabled/disabled-flag entries exist — all 13 classifiers in the `classifiers` array are active.\n\n**Composition:** 11 regex classifiers (with exact pattern text above), 1 NER classifier (`CLS-PII-NAME-001`, entity type `PERSON`), and 1 dictionary/heuristic classifier (`CLS-PHI-CONDITION-001`, whose heuristic component is the term-list matching above; no additional heuristic parameters are defined in the pinned file).\n\n```json\n{\n  "Name": "master_data_classifiers_ruleset_store",\n  "Inquiry": "Provide the full pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset (strict read-only): all enabled classifiers, including regex patterns (with exact pattern text), NER entity types, dictionary term lists, and heuristics, for PII and PHI detection. Include per-classifier category names, classifier_ids, priority values, and the confidence thresholds used to accept or reject detections. This ruleset will be used unmodified to scan a customer support / DSAR log document.",\n  "Mode": "Fulfill",\n  "Response": "Served the active pinned Master Data Classifiers ruleset, revision rev-001 (